  "atomic_questions": [
    "The brief says a skilled worker can train at most 3 new workers \"in any two-week period\" — does this mean a skilled worker can have up to 3 trainees at any time (so a worker who starts 3 trainees in weeks 1–2 cannot start another batch until those finish in weeks 3–4), or does it mean a skilled worker can start up to 3 new trainees in each individual week (so up to 6 could be in training simultaneously)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response presents a single clarification question asking the user to choose between two specific interpretations of the training constraint."
}

